  "rationale": "These scenarios add coverage for previously untested contract partitions: exact tenant/key identity with short and separator-heavy strings, release isolation on case-variant tenant/key pairs, retryability of a previously failed reservation after intervening stock changes, repeated release behavior with stock restoration observed on both reserved and untouched skus, payload binding conflicts after a successful key across sku/qty changes, and validation of stock/release requests with missing or invalid fields while checking that no silent stock changes occur.",
  "origin": "live OpenAI; fresh context, implementation withheld"
